            <link>https://wppconnect.io/blog/wa-js/v4.8.1/</link>
            <guid>https://wppconnect.io/blog/wa-js/v4.8.1/</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:48:02 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Today we are releasing a patch version v4.8.1 for WA-JS with Bug Fixes, Build System, Continuous Integration and Chores.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Today we are releasing a patch version v4.8.1 for WA-JS with Bug Fixes, Build System, Continuous Integration and Chores.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="481-2026-11-17"><small>4.8.1 (2026-11-17)</small><a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wa-js/v4.8.1/#481-2026-11-17" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 481-2026-11-17" title="Direct link to 481-2026-11-17" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="bug-fixes">Bug Fixes<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wa-js/v4.8.1/#bug-fixes" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Bug Fixes" title="Direct link to Bug Fixes" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>call:</strong> support modern rejection without mandatory enum binding (#3785) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/0e13026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">0e13026</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3785" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#3785</a></li>
<li class="">install message key serialization before incoming events (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/e457f76" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">e457f76</a>)</li>
<li class="">resolve About status and modern text status backends lazily (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/eca41f6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">eca41f6</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="build-system">Build System<a href="https://wppconnect.io/blog/wa-js/v4.8.1/#build-system" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Build System" title="Direct link to Build System" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> align the validated Playwright packages (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/87569fa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">87569fa</a>)</li>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update dependency @wppconnect/wa-version to ^1.5.5212 (#3783) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/d1a11da" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">d1a11da</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3783" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#3783</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update dependency @wppconnect/wa-version to ^1.5.5213 (#3784) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/93db471" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">93db471</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3784" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#3784</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update dependency @wppconnect/wa-version to ^1.5.5216 (#3786) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/43e4e91" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">43e4e91</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3786" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#3786</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update dependency lint-staged to ^17.6.1 (#3787) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/626a979" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">626a979</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3787" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#3787</a></li>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update the validated ESLint development graph (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/a71d4d9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">a71d4d9</a>)</li>
<li class=""><strong>deps-dev:</strong> update typescript-eslint monorepo to ^8.73.0 (#3789) (<a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/commit/649713f" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">649713f</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/wppconnect-team/wa-js/issues/3789" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#3789</a></li>
